whisper: Pong for two players. Left paddle: W and S. Right paddle: up and down arrows.
whisper: First to 5 wins. Space starts a new game.

genesis:
  open a world with "Pong", 800, 500
  set radius to 10
  set birth to 400 horizontal 250 vertical
  set speed to 5 horizontal 3 vertical
  set left y to 250
  set right y to 250
  set left score to 0
  set right score to 0
  set the text size to 40
  as long as the world lives:
    whisper: the paddles
    if key held "w": set left y to left y minus 7
    if key held "s": set left y to left y plus 7
    if key held "up": set right y to right y minus 7
    if key held "down": set right y to right y plus 7
    set left y to clamp left y between 50 and 450
    set right y to clamp right y between 50 and 450

    whisper: the ball moves, and bounces off the top and bottom
    if left score falls below 5 and right score falls below 5:
      set existence to existence plus speed
    if existence touches the top or bottom: set speed of vertical to speed of vertical times -1

    whisper: the ball hits a paddle: it goes back the other way, a little faster
    if existence of horizontal falls below 50 and existence of vertical is within 60 of left y and speed of horizontal falls below 0:
      set speed of horizontal to speed of horizontal times -1.05
    if existence of horizontal exceeds 750 and existence of vertical is within 60 of right y and speed of horizontal exceeds 0:
      set speed of horizontal to speed of horizontal times -1.05

    whisper: the ball gets past a paddle: the other player scores, and the ball starts again from the middle
    if existence touches a side:
      if existence of horizontal falls below 400:
        set right score to right score plus 1
        set speed to 5 horizontal 3 vertical
      otherwise:
        set left score to left score plus 1
        set speed to -5 horizontal 3 vertical
      set birth to 400 horizontal 250 vertical

    if key pressed "space":
      set left score to 0
      set right score to 0
      set birth to 400 horizontal 250 vertical

    consume the window with "black"
    etch a line with 400, 0, 400, 500, "#333333"
    etch a box with 22, left y minus 50, 16, 100, "white"
    etch a box with 762, right y minus 50, 16, 100, "white"
    etch a circle with existence of horizontal, existence of vertical, radius, "white"
    etch words with left score as text, 340, 20, "white"
    etch words with right score as text, 440, 20, "white"
    if left score is 5: etch words with "Left player wins! Press space.", 170, 220, "yellow"
    if right score is 5: etch words with "Right player wins! Press space.", 160, 220, "yellow"
    reveal the frame
and the universe said i love you
